        "b": 729.8029289281768
      },
      "content": "Warm up of Spindle"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0905",
      "reading_order": 1173,
      "section": "2-9. Check and Repair Before Operation Since Long-term Storage",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 141.841914,
        "t": 721.694756,
        "r": 533.1169020000013,
        "b": 712.8230369281769
      },
      "content": "Before operating since stopped for a long time, idle the machine in the following orders."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0906",
      "reading_order": 1174,
      "section": "2-9. Check and Repair Before Operation Since Long-term Storage",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 141.780792,
        "t": 704.714864,
        "r": 293.47156799999993,
        "b": 661.8232409281769
      },
      "content": "Clamp  the  rotation  speed  of spindle  to  1.000  rpm  for  a safety."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0907",
      "reading_order": 1175,
      "section": "2-9. Check and Repair Before Operation Since Long-term Storage",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 141.78079200000002,
        "t": 653.7150680000001,
        "r": 293.496618,
        "b": 627.8033369281769
      },
      "content": "Rotate  the  spindle  with  500 rpm for half an hour."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0908",
      "reading_order": 1176,
      "section": "2-9. Check and Repair Before Operation Since Long-term Storage",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 141.78079200000002,
        "t": 619.6951640000001,
        "r": 293.4865980000002,
        "b": 593.843552928177
      },
      "content": "Rotate the spindle with 1.000 rpm for half an hour."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0909",
      "reading_order": 1177,
      "section": "2-9. Check and Repair Before Operation Since Long-term Storage",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 141.78079200000002,
        "t": 585.6752600000001,
        "r": 233.3104860000001,
        "b": 576.803540928177
      },
      "content": "Stop the spindle."
    },
