        "r": 536.044482,
        "b": 476.8429289281768
      },
      "content": "If rotating the spindle in a high speed suddenly since stopped for a long time, it may result in a failure of the spindle bearing or chuck cylinder."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0911",
      "reading_order": 1181,
