        "r": 368.5380480000006,
        "b": 440.3029289281768
      },
      "content": "Warm up each axis (X- and Z-axes) and Tail Stock"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0912",
      "reading_order": 1182,
      "section": "2-9. Check and Repair Before Operation Since Long-term Storage",
